   "index": "b1O"
  },
  {
   "id": "t88",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240,
   "y": 810,
   "width": 300.3,
   "height": 157.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f69",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 116146606,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1280285447,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Twist (body):  v  m/s, w  rad/s (+left)\n\nstep(pose, twist, dt):\n w\u22480: x += v\u00b7cos\u03b8\u00b7dt\n      y += v\u00b7sin\u03b8\u00b7dt\n else r = v/w\n  x' = x + r(sin(\u03b8+w\u00b7dt) \u2212 sin\u03b8)\n  y' = y \u2212 r(cos(\u03b8+w\u00b7dt) \u2212 cos\u03b8)\n  \u03b8' = \u03b8 + w\u00b7dt  (not wrapped)",
   "originalText": "Twist (body):  v  m/s, w  rad/s (+left)\n\nstep(pose, twist, dt):\n w\u22480: x += v\u00b7cos\u03b8\u00b7dt\n      y += v\u00b7sin\u03b8\u00b7dt\n else r = v/w\n  x' = x + r(sin(\u03b8+w\u00b7dt) \u2212 sin\u03b8)\n  y' = y \u2212 r(cos(\u03b8+w\u00b7dt) \u2212 cos\u03b8)\n  \u03b8' = \u03b8 + w\u00b7dt  (not wrapped)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b1P"
  },
  {
   "id": "t89",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 850,
   "y": 1170,
   "width": 454.3,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f69",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 390887331,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1121481225,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Wheel sides:  v_L = v \u2212 w\u00b7track/2     v_R = v + w\u00b7track/2\nclamp:  fastest = |v| + |w|\u00b7track/2 \u2264 max_wheel_speed (0.8)\n        else scale v, w by max/fastest  (keeps turn radius)\nLimits: max_wheel_speed, max_accel (v\u0307), max_yaw_accel (\u1e87)",
   "originalText": "Wheel sides:  v_L = v \u2212 w\u00b7track/2     v_R = v + w\u00b7track/2\nclamp:  fastest = |v| + |w|\u00b7track/2 \u2264 max_wheel_speed (0.8)\n        else scale v, w by max/fastest  (keeps turn radius)\nLimits: max_wheel_speed, max_accel (v\u0307), max_yaw_accel (\u1e87)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b1Q"
  },
